LitePack: third-party notices
=============================

This file lists the third-party software in LitePack's shipped programs (lpk, from the crates lpk-cli,
lpk-core, lpk-format, lpk-codecs-bwt and lpk-codecs-vp8; and lpk-check) and reproduces the notices and
licence texts their licences require. It is generated by scripts/third-party-notices.sh with cargo-about
(about.toml, about.hbs, about-check.hbs); do not edit it by hand.

================================================================================
Third-party code inside LitePack's own crates
================================================================================

